1c:T4a9,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Can free Canva be used for selling?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Generally yes, for marketing materials and business content, following the licence of the elements you used. Prohibited uses include reselling raw elements as stock and selling a printed product made almost entirely of licensed elements. Check Canva's licence summary before mass production."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How can I get Canva Pro for free?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Officially: Canva for Education for verified teachers and students, the non-profit programme, or an official trial when offered. Cheap Pro accounts from random sellers are easily revoked and endanger your designs. For most small businesses, free Canva already suffices."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can a Canva logo be registered as a trademark?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Be careful: a design heavily based on templates and stock elements is usually not distinctive enough, and Canva itself limits stock-element use in registered logos. Treat Canva as a starting point, or work with a designer."}}]}12:["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-8 py-8","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home (EN)\",\"item\":\"https://cekapk.com/en\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Canva\",\"item\":\"https://cekapk.com/en/aplikasi/canva\"}]}"}}],["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$1c"}}],["$","nav",null,{"aria-label":"Breadcrumb","className":"text-sm text-ink/60","children":["$","ol",null,{"className":"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1","children":[["$","li","/en",{"className":"flex items-center gap-1","children":[false,["$","$L5",null,{"hre