22:["$","section",null,{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","p","Canva is a drag-and-drop design ",{"className":"leading-relaxed text-ink/85","children":"Canva is a drag-and-drop design platform that lets people with no design background produce tidy posters, presentations, invitations, simple logos, and social media content from templates. In Indonesia it is used daily by teachers, students, small businesses, and community admins."}],["$","p","This page explains the real diff",{"className":"leading-relaxed text-ink/85","children":"This page explains the real differences between free Canva and Canva Pro, its main features, the app's permissions, and the licensing notes free users most often forget. The button goes only to Play Store - your designs belong in the official app."}]]}]
23:["$","section",null,{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl font-bold text-ink","children":["What ","Canva"," Does"]}],[["$","p","Free Canva already covers millio",{"className":"leading-relaxed text-ink/85","children":"Free Canva already covers millions of templates, basic elements, and cloud storage - genuinely enough for personal projects and most small businesses. Canva Pro adds the full premium library, one-click background removal, magic resizing into many formats, and brand kits. There is also Canva for Education, free for verified teachers and students. Avoid cheap Pro accounts and foreign team invitations: they are often the product of abuse, can be revoked along with every design inside them, and a workspace shared with strangers means your designs can be copied."}],["$","p","Not everything inside Canva is f",{"className":"leading-relaxed text-ink/85","children":"Not everything inside Canva is free for every purpose. Licensed elements and photos come with conditions: generally fine for content and marketing, but you may not resell the raw elements as stock, sell a printed product that is almost entirely one licensed element, or register a template-based design as a trademark without meaningful change. For a long-term business identity, lean on simple elements and safe fonts. The phone app suits quick work; long documents are more comfortable on a computer."}]]]}]
24:["$","section",null,{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl font-bold text-ink","children":"Safety & Privacy"}],[["$","p","Official Canva from Play Store a",{"className":"leading-relaxed text-ink/85","children":"Official Canva from Play Store and its own site is safe. The typical Canva risk is not app malware but the account: cheap Pro services, team invitations from strangers, and reused passwords. If your account is taken over, every design inside it goes with it - use a unique password."}],["$","p","On the work side, respect elemen",{"className":"leading-relaxed text-ink/85","children":"On the work side, respect element licences and do not download paid assets from template-leaking sites. For anything used commercially at scale, choose elements whose status is clear, and keep your final exported files as your own records."}]]]}]
